WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:02.402
Meet the IRIV Edge dashboard.

2
00:00:02.402 --> 00:00:04.892
One screen for every controller, camera

3
00:00:04.892 --> 00:00:06.360
and sensor in the city.

4
00:00:07.583 --> 00:00:09.383
Every IRIV unit sits on the

5
00:00:09.383 --> 00:00:11.715
map, exactly where it is installed.

6
00:00:11.715 --> 00:00:13.048
Here is the airport.

7
00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:16.248
One button lists every IRIV unit.

8
00:00:16.248 --> 00:00:17.399
Click a row and the

9
00:00:17.399 --> 00:00:18.913
map flies straight to it.

10
00:00:20.117 --> 00:00:21.268
Open a unit to see

11
00:00:21.268 --> 00:00:22.547
what it is wired to.

12
00:00:22.547 --> 00:00:24.594
Sensors, relays and the network,

13
00:00:24.594 --> 00:00:26.065
with their live states.

14
00:00:27.283 --> 00:00:29.486
Below the wiring are the rules it runs.

15
00:00:29.486 --> 00:00:31.293
Each one shows its live reading,

16
00:00:31.293 --> 00:00:32.704
and whether it is firing.

17
00:00:33.917 --> 00:00:35.676
Every change is published as an

18
00:00:35.676 --> 00:00:36.868
M Q T T message, with

19
00:00:36.868 --> 00:00:38.344
its topic and its payload.

20
00:00:39.550 --> 00:00:40.731
Cut the network to see

21
00:00:40.731 --> 00:00:42.181
how a unit behaves offline.

22
00:00:42.181 --> 00:00:44.652
This PiControl keeps running its own rules and

23
00:00:44.652 --> 00:00:47.015
buffers its messages until the link returns.

24
00:00:48.217 --> 00:00:50.917
EdgeAI units open with a live camera view.

25
00:00:50.917 --> 00:00:53.103
The video never leaves the device.

26
00:00:53.103 --> 00:00:54.774
Only the results are sent.

27
00:00:55.983 --> 00:00:57.959
At the airport, the control centre

28
00:00:57.959 --> 00:01:00.457
brings cameras, flights, passengers and the

29
00:01:00.457 --> 00:01:02.142
car park onto one video wall.

30
00:01:03.350 --> 00:01:05.329
Open the live demo, press IRIV

31
00:01:05.329 --> 00:01:07.044
units, and click any unit.

32
00:01:07.044 --> 00:01:09.683
All readings in this film are simulated.

